WEBVTT

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:32.360
Important Announcement

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:33.450
Huh?

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:37.620
This game will be discontinued.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.230
Discontinued...

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:40.610
What?!

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:49.460
Suigin Regrets the End!

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:57.420
It's ending...

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:15.110
The world is ending...

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:21.470
My adventures with you...

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:27.350
Father, what is this?

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:30.990
I want you to hold onto this.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:35.960
If something happens, follow the 
instructions inside of it.

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:38.880
If something happens?

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.290
What do you mean?

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:45.270
It's nothing to worry about. 
It's just a precaution.

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:50.940
<i>Dungeon Century</i> has finished 
its role as a prototype.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.980
The new game that's about to start...

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:58.030
That will be the game that 
will truly change the world.

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:01.650
It's a reality that surpasses reality.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:04.160
Father?

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:11.880
And right when you ended up 
with a partner you liked...

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:15.290
W-Were you monitoring me?

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:19.760
Well, I was worried about 
my precious daughter.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:22.960
Ugh! How could you, Father?

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:24.640
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:29.190
Gwin-san!

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:41.240
What's that?

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:42.730
Shh! Don't look!

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:44.160
Let's go.

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:49.300
Down in the dumps, huh?

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.040
Hey, Ranshou-kun.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:53.420
What's wrong, Suigin?

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:56.840
I thought you were enjoying 
your nightly rendezvous.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.290
Until the world ends, yeah.

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:02.340
The world?

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:05.230
But you know...

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:07.170
Even if the game is going 
to be discontinued,

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.390
all you need to do is get 
closer to her in real life.

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:16.940
She... She only knows the 
me inside the game.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.660
What the heck?

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:20.950
So it's a one-sided love with 
someone you've never actually met?

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:25.590
We live in two completely 
different worlds.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:33.070
I wonder if he'll be okay.

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:38.400
Even if he burns within the flames, 
he'll rise again from the ashes.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:40.950
That's the kind of guy he is.

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:43.510
You're so wonderful, Ranshou-kun.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.370
Work...

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:53.700
I need to get to work.

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:01.490
Sir, your upcoming schedule...

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:05.240
You have an executive meeting 
at the office at 4 PM.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.540
After that, you have a 
meeting with President Ling

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.710
concerning the announcement 
of the new game.

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:11.740
Right.

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:15.500
Riku Rei!

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.450
It's not good for your skin if you 
stay up too late every night.

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:21.460
Thanks. I'll be fine.

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:24.960
Well, I'm going to bed.

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:27.320
Good night, Maki-chan.

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:40.900
Man, what's up with discontinuing 
the service just like that?

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:44.330
How much do they think 
I spent on this game?

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:45.400
Seriously!

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:48.580
This is just what I heard, but...

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:53.910
Apparently there's an item somewhere in this 
world that will grant you any single wish.

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:56.170
You're talking about the 
Evening Song Flower, right?

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:59.340
Then if we found that, maybe we could stop 
them from discontinuing the game...

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:01.210
Like they could go back on that.

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.540
That's ridiculous.

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:07.140
Well, anyway, this game's 
going to end soon.

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:10.080
Let's just go all out until that happens.

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:19.760
I wonder if Gwin-san will show up soon...

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.390
<i>I'm going to be parting with you soon...</i>

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:47.230
<i>And there's nothing...</i>

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:51.150
<i>There's nothing that I can do.</i>

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:01.140
You're late, Gwin-san.

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:04.700
Were you busy?

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.650
It's fine. Let's go.

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:17.430
This is going to end in a week...

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:23.410
So until then...

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:29.170
Let's enjoy all the adventures 
that this game has to offer!

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:30.890
Let's go!

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:35.680
<i>Yes, to her...</i>

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:39.690
<i>This is just one game among many others.</i>

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:44.440
<i>And I'm just one of her game buddies.</i>

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:46.440
<i>But...</i>

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.270
<i>What's wrong with that?</i>

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:53.400
<i>Even now, in this game...</i>

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:57.450
<i>I'm alone with you...</i>

00:07:57.980 --> 00:07:59.240
<i>I'm able...</i>

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:03.660
<i>to be with you.</i>

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:21.960
Gwin-san.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:28.700
There's an item that I want 
to find, no matter what.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:32.320
It's a special variation of this Song Flower.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.980
Apparently, it's called the 
Evening Song Flower.

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:43.120
Here.

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:50.630
It's apparently growing in some field,

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:55.880
but I want to find it, no matter what,
 before this game ends.

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:02.520
Gwin-san?

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:11.530
Will you find it...

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:15.880
With me?

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:20.740
Th-Thank you, Gwin-san!

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:22.400
Thank you!

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:35.180
<i>Together with you...</i>

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:42.150
G.G.T.C Corporate Building

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:44.730
<i>To everyone in the world!</i>

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:50.140
<i>We at the God Grave Tech 
Company proudly present...</i>

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:54.150
<i>The ultimate online game!</i>

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:58.210
<i>Its name is </i>Grave Buster!<i></i>

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:03.170
<i>In </i>Grave Buster<i>, the players 
will be grave robbers</i>

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:07.170
<i>and get various treasures 
that are within each stage!</i>

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:09.760
<i>And to help you,</i>

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:14.430
<i>we have a new system where your financial 
strength will be the ultimate strength.</i>

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:20.420
<i>The more the players pay, the more 
powerful they can become.</i>

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:25.980
<i>And all players who register to play 
will receive a special console</i>

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:29.480
<i>called Seabay, specifically designed 
for </i>Grave Buster<i>, absolutely free!</i>

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:32.950
Now, get out there and uncover 
the ancient tombs...

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:35.190
...and aim for the ultimate 
financial power!

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:37.980
Many treasures...

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:40.370
...are waiting to be dug up!

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:42.860
Reality that surpasses reality!

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:46.380
That is the essence of <i>Grave Buster!</i>

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:51.040
We were finally able to announce the game.

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:57.490
This is all thanks to the genius 
game designer, Riku Yuuki.

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:02.760
This is only the beginning to everything...

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:06.270
To everything...

00:11:06.760 --> 00:11:08.910
<i>Reality that surpasses reality!</i>

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:11.130
<i></i>Grave Buster!<i></i>

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:22.650
Gwin-san, over here!

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:04.920
Next Time
Suigin Receives a Loss!

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:03.680
The Silver Guardian!
